{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105482","id":2465331706,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6S8fn6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105482","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105482.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105482.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105482","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105482/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105482/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105482/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cf8455c52d8056be23cc3cbeb042879fff9e13c9","number":105482,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix regression causing jittery canvas transforms","user":{"login":"maxpiepenbrink","id":240875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink","html_url":"https://github.com/maxpiepenbrink","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104451 introduced a tricky regression. Canvas item transforms could risk not being updated for multiple frames due to the conditional on the line in this commit. Before the \"approx_pos|size_changed\" fix, the transform would get updated incidentally either way. But now there's a gap where (pos_changed && !size_changed) may not be true for a few frames and there's nothing else left to trigger a transform update.\r\n\r\nThe fix is quite simple: remain trigger happy around position changes and make sure to update the item transform if position has changed at all, but now respect the `approx_size_changed`, as `size_changed` was often true due to minor floating point accumulation that the original PR was addressing in some ways.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105483\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine